## Purpose

The owner likes the4174study and requests half-speed cream on both sides,
slightly more transparent glass over the whole website and etched bakery icons.
They explicitly want to review it before deciding on official-site integration.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the previous experiment and official-site file hashes.
- [x] Halve ambient orbit and breathing rates without lowering the rendering ceiling.
- [x] Arrange two cohesive side groups while retaining the small cursor trail and added scoops.
