## Acceptance criteria

- This affects only experiments\cream-metaballs and local documentation/evidence.
- No official-site source/build/publication or Instagram action.
- Two default connected groups remain on their left/right sides over time and resize.
- Animation phases are half the former rate; pointer/trail interaction remains intact.
- Whole viewport is frosted behind header/content/footer, not merely a central card.
- Original etched linework is visible and noninteractive; no reference pixels copied.
- Pause/reduced motion/visibility/print/forced colours/graphics-failure controls remain.
- Owner review and explicit production integration permission remain separate.

